---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Devotion Room">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: September 12, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section content-section">
    <div class="container max-w-content">
      <div class="card p-xl">
        <div class="policy-text">
          <p>Devotion Room (“we,” “our,” or “us”) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you visit devotionroom.ca.</p>
          
          <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>Devotion Room does not require you to create an account or provide personal information to browse and use this website.</p>
          <p>The website is a static website and does not currently use Google Analytics, Meta Pixel, advertising trackers, or other analytics/tracking services.</p>
          <p>We do not have contact forms, newsletter signups, or other mechanisms on this website that intentionally collect personal information.</p>
          
          <h2>Cookies</h2>
          <p>Devotion Room does not currently use cookies for analytics, advertising, or tracking purposes.</p>
          <p>Some third-party content or services linked to or embedded on the website may use cookies or collect information when you interact with them. These third parties have their own privacy policies and practices.</p>
          
          <h2>Third-Party Services and Content</h2>
          <p>Devotion Room may include links to or embedded content from third-party services, including YouTube, Spotify, Apple Podcasts, and other external websites or platforms.</p>
          <p>When you interact with third-party content, those services may collect information according to their own privacy policies. Devotion Room does not control the privacy practices of these third parties.</p>
          <p>We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party service you use through our website.</p>
          
          <h2>External Links</h2>
          <p>This website may contain links to other websites. Devotion Room is not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or security of external websites.</p>
          
          <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Devotion Room does not knowingly collect personal information from children through this website.</p>
          
          <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time if the website or its services change. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated “Last updated” date.</p>
          
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how Devotion Room handles information, please contact us through the contact information provided on the website.</p>
          
          <p>
            Devotion Room<br />
            <a href="https://devotionroom.ca">https://devotionroom.ca</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0 var(--spacing-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  
  .content-section {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .max-w-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  
  .card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  
  .p-xl {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  
  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .policy-text {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
  
  .policy-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .policy-text p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  
  .policy-text a {
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  
  .policy-text a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .p-xl {
      padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    }
    
    .page-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
